Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:35:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0106/3799] soh: rename D_80153D3C -> sUnusedMsgData

Name source: deduced from the code (confidence HIGH).
Defined in soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c b/soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c
index 77912cee9..91e690772 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_message_PAL.c
@@ -4393,7 +4393,8 @@ void Message_Update(PlayState* play) {
     static s16 sTextboxEndIconYOffset[] = {
         59, 59, 59, 59, 34, 59,
     };
-    static s16 D_80153D3C[] = {
+    // LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80153D3C: array never read; inline comment calls it additional unreferenced data.
+    static s16 sUnusedMsgData[] = {
         // additional unreferenced data
         0x0400, 0x0400, 0x0200, 0x0000, 0x1038, 0x0008, 0x200A, 0x088B, 0x0007, 0x0009, 0x000A, 0x107E, 0x2008, 0x2007,
         0x0015, 0x0016, 0x0017, 0x0003, 0x0000, 0x270B, 0x00C8, 0x012C, 0x012D, 0xFFDA, 0x0014, 0x0016, 0x0014, 0x0016,
